<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Australian All Ordinaries index hits new high.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Australian All Ordinaries index hits new high.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Australian Stock Exchange's benchmark indicator, the All Ordinaries index, reached a record high of 2427.7 in afternoon trade on Thursday.  </p>
<p>This surpassed the previous record high of 2,426.5 reached on December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>The All Ordinaries index record closing level is 2,424.6, also achieved on December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373 1800</p>
</text>
